    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIEg">III Eg</ref> 7.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif aðer oððe mæg oððe fremde ða rade forsace, gilde þam cyninge hundtwelftig scill'.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone, either kinsman or stranger, refuses to ride [against him], he shall pay the king 120 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf aðor oððe mǽg oþþe fremde þa rade forsace, gylde þam cynge hundtwelftig scill'.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
